{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16808","headline":"仲秋夜郡内西亭对月 · 张登","name":"仲秋夜郡内西亭对月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天高月满影悠悠，一夜炎荒并觉秋。\n气与露清凝衆草，色如霜白怯轻裘。\n高临华宇还知隙，静映长江不共流。\n囗直西倾河汉曙，遗风犹想武昌楼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张登","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16808.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16808","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}